            {
                "comment": "I had prof Spector for EdPsych 326 (mind, brain, & education) last fall. I think she usually teaches at Edgewood but has taught a few classes for UW. She is very passionate and very knowledgeable about the class and is also caring about the students. She replaced midterms/final exams with 6 quizzes that were concept-based, not testing random facts.",
